mindmap
  root(("Branch 2: QA/QC job roles 2026"))
    Manual tester
      Responsibilities
        Analyse requirements and user stories
        Design test cases with black-box techniques
        Exploratory and regression testing
        Log defects with severity and priority
        Retest fixes and report results
      Skills
        EP, BVA, decision table, state transition
        Domain and business knowledge
        Jira or similar tracker
        Postman and SQL basics
        Clear written English
    Automation engineer / SDET
      Responsibilities
        Build and maintain UI and API automation
        Integrate tests into CI/CD pipelines
        Triage flaky tests and failures
        Performance and load scripts
      Skills
        Playwright, Selenium, Cypress
        TypeScript, Java or Python
        REST/GraphQL, REST Assured, Postman
        Git, Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Docker
        JMeter or k6
    AI/LLM QA tester
      Responsibilities
        Test chatbots, RAG and AI features
        Check accuracy, grounding, hallucination
        Check consistency across prompt variants
        Test bias, safety, prompt injection
        Build evaluation datasets and golden sets
        Verify AI regulation needs e.g. EU AI Act logging
      Skills
        Prompt engineering
        LLM evaluation metrics and tools
        Python and data testing
        OWASP Top 10 for LLM applications
        Strong domain judgement
    QA lead
      Responsibilities
        Test strategy, test plan, estimation
        Entry and exit criteria, release risk
        Lead in-house and outsourced testers
        Report quality metrics to stakeholders
        Govern safe use of GenAI tools in QA
      Skills
        Test management and risk-based testing
        Leadership and mentoring
        Stakeholder communication
        Automation architecture awareness
    Quality engineer
      Responsibilities
        Embed quality across the whole SDLC
        CI/CD quality gates
        Shift-left and shift-right testing
        Production monitoring and observability
        Define acceptance criteria with product owners
      Skills
        Automation and API testing
        Contract testing e.g. PACT
        Observability tools e.g. Grafana
        SQL and data validation
        AI-assisted testing tools
    Process QA
      Responsibilities
        Define and maintain development and test processes
        Audit projects against processes and standards
        Track non-conformities and corrective actions
        Collect process metrics e.g. defect escape rate
        Drive process improvement
      Skills
        ISO 9001, CMMI, ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119
        Audit techniques
        Root cause analysis: 5 Whys, fishbone
        Metrics and basic statistics
        Facilitation and training
